	(descr "Coilcraft XAL1510 series shielded power inductor, body 15.2x16.2x10.0mm, land pattern 2x 3.18x13.2mm pads on 10.6mm pitch, per Coilcraft Document 947-3 rev 05/04/26 (https://www.coilcraft.com/getmedia/cd1cef27-13f0-4568-8894-f7311475209b/xal1510.pdf). Pad 1 is the MARKED START (SHORT) LEAD - Coilcraft specifies connecting it to the high dv/dt node (the switch node) for lowest EMI. Solder paste is reduced 0.25mm per side (~81% of pad area); Coilcraft publish no stencil recommendation, see hardware/kicad/lib/README.md.")
